--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Scope

The MIT grant above covers the material authored for this release: the three
evaluation environments, their certification suites, the reference and deficient
policies, the reward checkers, the task and perturbation manifests, the frozen
per-rollout snapshots, and the analysis scripts under analysis/.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components

These are used under their own licenses and are not covered by the grant above.
They are not redistributed here; the environments expect them to be installed
separately (see README.md > Paths).

  CUA-Gym Hub substrate   Apache-2.0      web-application mocks underlying the
                                          hotel and travel environments
  Mailpit v1.31.0         MIT             SMTP server and web UI used by the
                                          clinic environment
  xdotool 3.20160805.1    BSD-3-Clause    synthesises X11 input events
  scrot                   MIT-feh /       screen capture
                          BSD-3-Clause

The agent under evaluation is proprietary and reached only through a commercial
API (Claude Code as the harness; Claude Opus 5 as the model). This is why the
frozen snapshots are released: scoring, re-scoring, and every analysis step run
offline against them with no model calls.
